props.description:
`popover` is Figma Search/Popover: always Small, Corner-Radius/Input/Medium, no focus ring. Its border is
Input/Border/Default (Hover: Input/Border/Hover), visible only in outlined component themes (Neutral S4, S6);
Focused/Typing use Input/Border/Popover-Search, visible only in Neutral S7. `size` is ignored.

Replying to a message: a "Replying to …" bar above the field (× or Escape cancels). Attach it to what you send.
Setting it (or switching to another message) moves focus into the field, so Reply leaves the caret ready to type;
a composer that mounts with a reply already set does not take focus.

Cross-axis alignment. Default: rows center their items; columns stretch fields, cards and lists to the full width
while buttons, chips, badges, tags and avatars keep their own width (pass `align="stretch"` to stretch those too,
e.g. full-width buttons in a mobile footer).
